WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.821
Trace one fictional user from discovery to follow-up.

00:00:03.821 --> 00:00:14.805
They understand the scope, make an informed choice, receive the guide, begin, complete the practice, review it and know how to obtain help.

00:00:14.805 --> 00:00:25.311
The estimate practice remains two hours at fifty dollars per hour plus fifteen dollars: one hundred fifteen dollars, with excluded costs visible.

00:00:25.311 --> 00:00:30.087
Explain what happens if the resource is missing or inaccessible.

00:00:30.087 --> 00:00:35.818
Verify policy and delivery claims against approved information and confirmed owner capacity.

00:00:35.818 --> 00:00:39.161
Inspect privacy, readable materials, feedback and completion.

00:00:39.161 --> 00:00:45.369
Use the exact AI review request, then reject invented guarantees and manipulative steps.

00:00:45.369 --> 00:00:53.488
Save the connected map, two corrected instructions and human decision in the same Project Record and workbook.

00:00:53.488 --> 00:00:59.219
A scenario does not establish reliable live delivery or actual customer satisfaction.
